              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 760,
              "content": "Four steps made the common case (a folder, a CLI, a sentence) cost as much as the rare one. It is one screen now: the three things every agent needs are visible at once, the task is the field you land on because it is what you came to type, and everything else sits behind one row that says what it currently holds. Teams are the same screen with a switch, instead of a separate dialog nobody finds.",
