                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When: saving would give the role to an agent while another agent of the same project holds it. That is switching the toggle on, creating an agent with it on, moving an orchestrator into another project, or deploying a team with an orchestrator member into a project that has one.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "W9zps",
                  "name": "note",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "It names the agent that loses the role. Cancel goes back to the dialog as it was, the toggle still on.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "EF2yC",
                  "name": "note",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "After Replace the list is read again, so the other agent shows as a worker everywhere at once: the order of the Agents page, the first panel of the Dashboard, the agent dialog.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "oiKo4",
                  "name": "note",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The toggle sets the role and nothing else: the permission mode and the character stay as they are. Renaming an agent never changes its role.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
