              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 946,
              "content": "The Claude accounts section of Settings > AI & Providers, after Providers. Off by default. On, it lists up to five Claude subscriptions, each its own Claude Code folder signed in by Claude Code itself, with the email, plan and agents Claude Code and Tars report for it, and its 5 h and weekly use against the two thresholds. A tick on each bar marks its threshold; the bar turns the waiting colour past it and the error colour at the limit. An account's use switch takes it out of the running without signing it out, and its name is edited in place.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
