              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 946,
              "content": "With the option on and more than one account, every Claude agent shows the account it runs on, small, after its provider and model: on its card in Agents, its pane header on the Dashboard and its window. The name opens a menu that pins the agent to an account. With the option off, or a single account, none of this shows, and an agent on another provider never shows one.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
